cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "OpenMunicipality"
abstract: >-
  Open-source web application that explains Spanish municipal budgets in plain
  language, using the Ministry of Finance CONPREL database: per-resident
  figures, comparisons with municipalities of a similar size, year-on-year
  changes, spending types and programmes, in Spanish and English.
type: software
